      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In fact, Section 38 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 would call upon the owner of the premises to assume responsibility for the seized materials."
